# THE BROWSER-SIDE BASE: '/' = the same-origin (the vite-proxy
# forwards /api -> the backend). The direct-8000 was the SECOND
# host — the per-host 6-connection limit + CORS caused the periodic
# 'Backend Unavailable' toasts (the 08-29 root-cause!)
VITE_API_URL=/

# The backend's own settings — provider keys, the database, tracing — are NOT
# browser variables and do not belong in this file. They live in the generated
# `.env.example` at the repository root (copied to `.env`), which is the only
# place a secret goes.
#
# Two mock flags used to live here (`VITE_DISABLE_MOCKS`, `VITE_USE_PROVIDER_MOCKS`);
# nothing reads either, so they are gone rather than documented as switches.
